      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Backend Pagination\n\nsplits data into chunks (pages) and returns only that page\nof data when requested\n\nPaginate on the backend when there is lots of data\n\n\nOn the backend in DRF it's really easy\ncreate a pagination class that extends PageNumberPagination\nadd that class to your viewset",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Backend Pagination\n\nsplits data into chunks (pages) and returns only that page\nof data when requested\n\nPaginate on the backend when there is lots of data\n\n\nOn the backend in DRF it's really easy\ncreate a pagination class that extends PageNumberPagination\nadd that class to your viewset",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
